# What `railway up` must not upload.
#
# The CLI already respects .gitignore, so .env is excluded either way. This is
# belt and braces for the one file whose accidental upload would put a local
# database URL and operator identity into a build log.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
dist
web/dist
.blobs
.demo-blobs
.pgsql
.pgdata
.git
coverage
*.log
